WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 25=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.820 --> 01:42.740
Zheng Baichuan!

01:43.900 --> 01:45.059
Are you trying to rebel?

01:46.300 --> 01:48.059
You insolent fool,
spouting such nonsense!

01:48.580 --> 01:49.779
His Majesty is gravely ill

01:50.168 --> 01:51.740
and has passed the throne to Prince Han.

01:54.619 --> 01:56.059
By His Majesty's command,

01:56.248 --> 01:57.752
I am here to execute the traitors.

01:58.139 --> 01:59.059
Nonsense!

01:59.419 --> 02:01.219
You're the one spouting lies,

02:01.460 --> 02:02.660
trying to turn Prince Han

02:02.660 --> 02:04.259
against his brother, the Crown Prince.

02:15.210 --> 02:16.504
Thank you both for your help.

02:17.300 --> 02:18.539
That was terrifying.

02:20.460 --> 02:21.300
My clothes are thick.

02:23.100 --> 02:24.059
It's only a flesh wound.

02:29.619 --> 02:30.460
Impossible.

02:30.860 --> 02:32.700
I clearly heard
the Crown Prince speaking.

02:32.930 --> 02:35.064
I saw the Crown Prince
go onstage with my own eyes!

02:36.499 --> 02:38.740
It was merely ventriloquism.

02:38.939 --> 02:41.980
Just a trick to amuse the nobles.

02:42.659 --> 02:44.580
His Highness has already
left for the capital

02:44.580 --> 02:45.580
on His Majesty's orders.

02:50.020 --> 02:50.779
Chengze.

02:51.020 --> 02:53.099
You should offer
your brother-in-law a proper toast.

02:56.050 --> 02:57.320
Thank you for your help today.

02:57.939 --> 02:58.580
We're family.

02:58.860 --> 02:59.580
It's only right.

03:02.619 --> 03:03.420
You may go.

03:06.099 --> 03:07.300
I want to take the stage.

03:07.819 --> 03:09.460
Even Duke Xianguo has agreed.

03:09.700 --> 03:12.219
Duke Xianguo, it's time for me
to change into my costume.

03:15.100 --> 03:16.100
Take care, Commander Lin.

03:16.110 --> 03:17.350
We're here to escort the bride.

03:17.499 --> 03:19.099
Take care, Commander Liu.

03:19.819 --> 03:20.580
Liu Xiaochuan.

03:20.648 --> 03:22.360
Don't you dare throw up in my carriage.

03:28.700 --> 03:29.499
All right.

03:29.880 --> 03:32.310
Even if they manage to slip out
of the Marquis's Residence,

03:32.420 --> 03:34.460
they won't get out of Jinling City!

03:35.219 --> 03:35.860
Kill them!

03:36.659 --> 03:37.260
Kill them!

03:37.499 --> 03:39.180
Kill them all!

03:40.219 --> 03:40.539
Go!

03:48.219 --> 03:49.020
Hurry, Manyi!

03:49.219 --> 03:50.260
They're killing people!

03:50.900 --> 03:52.619
Hurry!

03:54.580 --> 03:55.619
Hurry!

03:56.099 --> 03:57.020
Go!

04:14.020 --> 04:14.900
Kill them!

04:15.460 --> 04:16.260
You go on ahead.

04:16.700 --> 04:17.380
Go!

04:22.299 --> 04:22.779
This way!

04:41.288 --> 04:43.460
By order of His Highness,
we're leaving the city.

04:43.480 --> 04:44.770
Open the city gate immediately!

04:44.824 --> 04:46.280
Anyone who disobeys will be executed!

04:46.339 --> 04:48.390
(Shence Gate)
Without Duke Xianguo's written order,

04:48.400 --> 04:50.088
even if His Highness came in person,

04:50.140 --> 04:52.310
he still wouldn't be allowed
to leave the city tonight!

05:01.000 --> 05:03.020
By order of His Highness,
we're leaving the city!

05:03.460 --> 05:05.176
(Decree)
Open the city gate immediately!

05:05.272 --> 05:06.920
Anyone who disobeys will be executed!

05:11.820 --> 05:12.620
Open the gate!

05:14.140 --> 05:15.060
- Make way!
- Make way!

05:21.368 --> 05:23.880
The sooner His Highness
returns to the capital, the better.

05:23.900 --> 05:26.280
With swift horses, the overland route
would be faster.

05:26.299 --> 05:28.020
Prince Han once followed His Majesty

05:28.500 --> 05:30.339
from Tongzhou all the way to Jinling,

05:30.539 --> 05:32.460
so he knows this route very well.

05:32.460 --> 05:33.820
Now that he commands the troops,

05:33.820 --> 05:35.150
if he sets ambushes along the way,

05:35.192 --> 05:36.140
even the swiftest horses

05:36.280 --> 05:37.850
would have no hope of getting through.

05:37.940 --> 05:39.320
Traveling by water may seem slower,

05:39.339 --> 05:40.620
but from Jinling to Yangzhou,

05:40.620 --> 05:42.140
(Jinling - Yangzhou)
your Naval Camp can escort him,

05:42.150 --> 05:43.370
making it safer than traveling overland.

05:43.380 --> 05:44.140
Your Highness.

05:44.200 --> 05:45.170
Hold on a little longer.

05:45.419 --> 05:46.380
Once we reach Wuma Ferry,

05:46.500 --> 05:48.380
we'll be safe aboard
the ship Chengze arranged.

05:49.539 --> 05:50.219
I'm fine.

05:50.940 --> 05:51.900
Full speed ahead.

05:52.060 --> 05:53.339
But from Yangzhou to the capital,

05:53.340 --> 05:54.730
how can we ensure His Highness's safety?

05:54.740 --> 05:56.890
I once saved Luo Dalang,
Leader of the Boatmen's Guild.

05:57.020 --> 05:57.859
If this works out,

05:59.099 --> 06:00.419
this canal will be yours

06:01.219 --> 06:02.380
to command from now on.

06:05.299 --> 06:07.020
Fortune favors the bold.

06:07.480 --> 06:08.690
Then I'll bring my trusted men

06:08.700 --> 06:10.830
and the Boatmen's Guild's best men
to escort him all the way.

06:10.840 --> 06:12.840
We'll make sure
he returns to the capital in time.

06:42.260 --> 06:43.859
Xu Lanxiang.

06:50.859 --> 06:52.700
I underestimated you.

06:53.060 --> 06:54.060
Tell me.

06:54.900 --> 06:57.179
Did you conspire with Lin Jinqi

06:57.179 --> 06:58.620
to plot against my father and me?

06:58.620 --> 06:59.299
No.

07:00.140 --> 07:00.979
Absolutely not.

07:02.700 --> 07:03.900
My original plan was

07:04.728 --> 07:06.824
to lure Old Madam Yuan
and the other ladies over

07:07.219 --> 07:09.219
when you came to catch the ghost,

07:09.288 --> 07:10.600
so they could hear the truth.

07:13.020 --> 07:13.659
I never expected

07:13.820 --> 07:15.820
His Highness to suddenly
play the Mountain Deity,

07:16.536 --> 07:18.664
so I simply
took advantage of the opportunity.

07:19.576 --> 07:21.460
I didn't know
Young Master Lin and the others

07:21.460 --> 07:24.339
would use a decoy Crown Prince in place
of the real one to play it.

07:24.820 --> 07:25.979
Lanxiang truly didn't know.

07:26.360 --> 07:28.090
If she'd known
about Commander Lin's plan,

07:28.099 --> 07:28.820
she would've slipped away.

07:28.820 --> 07:30.390
She never would've put herself in danger

07:30.408 --> 07:33.060
by going anywhere near the
Mountain Deity and ending up like this.

08:00.419 --> 08:03.260
Lin Jinqi didn't care
whether you lived or died either.

08:05.560 --> 08:08.168
That was all a misunderstanding
on your part, Young Lady Zheng.

08:08.419 --> 08:09.460
That pot of orchids

08:09.832 --> 08:11.620
was given to me
by Young Master Lin's maid.

08:11.720 --> 08:13.608
Young Master Lin merely passed it along.

08:18.539 --> 08:20.339
That's what men are like.

08:22.419 --> 08:24.020
That's what men are like.

08:25.060 --> 08:27.339
All they care about is power.

08:31.460 --> 08:32.380
Young Lady Zheng.

08:32.536 --> 08:33.992
Since it was all a misunderstanding,

08:35.020 --> 08:36.860
there's no need for us to fall out

08:36.860 --> 08:37.900
over a wretched man.

08:38.100 --> 08:39.380
Put down the blade.

08:39.779 --> 08:40.980
I'll withdraw my testimony.

08:41.260 --> 08:42.100
From now on,

08:42.260 --> 08:43.819
we'll each go our separate ways.

08:44.184 --> 08:45.900
We'll pretend
none of this ever happened.

08:46.419 --> 08:47.620
In your dreams!

08:49.900 --> 08:51.020
Don't blame me.

08:52.100 --> 08:54.539
Lin Jinqi is the one who got you killed.

08:57.579 --> 08:58.100
Run!

08:58.579 --> 08:59.340
Xu Lanxiang!

09:31.380 --> 09:32.260
What are you doing?

09:32.419 --> 09:33.220
Xu Lanxiang!

09:33.340 --> 09:34.220
Let go of me!

09:35.699 --> 09:37.100
What are you doing? Let go of me!

09:47.860 --> 09:50.100
His Highness has safely left Jinling

09:50.179 --> 09:51.539
and is on his way to the capital!

09:51.699 --> 09:54.140
His Highness has safely left Jinling

09:54.220 --> 09:55.620
and is on his way to the capital!

09:55.740 --> 09:58.299
His Highness has safely left Jinling

09:58.539 --> 10:00.459
and is on his way to the capital!

10:45.340 --> 10:46.699
Why surrender?

10:55.620 --> 10:57.100
Why surrender?

11:02.020 --> 11:03.500
We've already gone this far.

11:04.100 --> 11:05.779
Why surrender?

12:04.100 --> 12:05.419
My parents are easily frightened.

12:05.420 --> 12:06.490
What happened last night...

12:06.536 --> 12:08.530
Last night, we stayed with the troupe.

12:17.299 --> 12:18.020
Mother!

12:26.419 --> 12:26.980
Mother!

12:29.900 --> 12:30.819
Mother!

12:40.299 --> 12:41.020
Mother!

12:41.740 --> 12:42.659
Grandpa Tu!

12:46.860 --> 12:48.939
Father. Mister Lu.

12:49.179 --> 12:50.020
Lanxiang.

12:51.299 --> 12:53.740
This calls for a celebratory drink.

12:54.579 --> 12:56.140
When did you get back?

12:57.059 --> 12:58.220
We arrived last night.

12:58.520 --> 13:00.340
We saw the city gates open this morning,

13:00.340 --> 13:00.980
so we came back.

13:10.260 --> 13:11.059
It's you?

13:12.819 --> 13:13.299
I...

13:13.900 --> 13:14.939
My name is Zhi.

13:16.059 --> 13:17.900
Mister Lu and Uncle Xu

13:18.380 --> 13:20.140
bought my freedom from Qingyan House.

13:22.779 --> 13:23.579
That's wonderful.

13:24.459 --> 13:25.140
Where's Ji'er?

13:25.340 --> 13:26.220
Is she inside?

13:27.659 --> 13:28.140
Lanxiang.

13:28.900 --> 13:29.819
Come, sit down.

13:30.059 --> 13:31.419
Sit down and listen to Mister Lu.

13:34.179 --> 13:34.659
Sit.

13:38.380 --> 13:39.299
Sit down, Zhi.

13:48.860 --> 13:51.020
By the time we reached Qingyan House,

13:52.220 --> 13:52.900
Ji'er

13:53.419 --> 13:55.740
had already been sold by the madam

13:55.740 --> 13:57.779
to a traveling merchant
passing through Yangzhou.

14:00.179 --> 14:01.059
That same day,

14:02.260 --> 14:04.860
the merchant left Yangzhou.

14:23.579 --> 14:24.579
It's all my fault.

14:25.539 --> 14:27.179
I dragged Ji'er into this.

14:28.500 --> 14:29.939
If she hadn't saved me,

14:30.500 --> 14:32.220
the madam wouldn't have sold her.

14:34.220 --> 14:35.020
It's not your fault.

14:35.720 --> 14:37.144
It's my fault for being so useless.

14:37.220 --> 14:39.500
What good does it do to talk like that?

14:40.740 --> 14:42.140
Where there's a will, there's a way.

14:45.860 --> 14:46.659
Right.

14:47.980 --> 14:50.140
We need to find that merchant first

14:50.220 --> 14:51.179
and bring Ji'er back.

14:52.819 --> 14:55.059
Do you know the merchant's name,

14:55.100 --> 14:56.059
where he's from,

14:56.500 --> 14:57.779
or what business he's in?

14:58.659 --> 15:00.939
The madam only met him once,

15:01.320 --> 15:02.690
so she couldn't tell us anything.

15:03.140 --> 15:04.860
All she knew was that he was wealthy.

15:05.459 --> 15:06.220
Shuang...

15:07.980 --> 15:09.819
When Young Lady Ji'er left,

15:10.179 --> 15:11.500
I was hanging clothes out to dry.

15:12.020 --> 15:14.340
There was a brand
on the merchant's mule.

15:14.620 --> 15:15.860
I took a closer look

15:16.380 --> 15:17.419
and remembered it.

15:18.900 --> 15:19.900
Mister Lu drew this

15:20.500 --> 15:23.100
based on Zhi's description.

15:24.260 --> 15:25.500
That merchant

15:25.740 --> 15:27.620
went to Yangzhou once,

15:28.020 --> 15:30.059
so he may well go there again.

15:31.299 --> 15:33.539
I've already asked
my friends in Yangzhou

15:33.699 --> 15:35.020
to keep an eye out.

15:36.340 --> 15:38.459
A mule that large wandering around

15:38.779 --> 15:40.500
with such an obvious brand

15:40.620 --> 15:41.980
is bound to be noticed by someone.

15:42.819 --> 15:44.179
We'll keep asking around.

15:50.860 --> 15:52.220
No matter where she is,

15:52.740 --> 15:54.539
I will find Ji'er.

15:58.140 --> 15:59.059
Thank you.

15:59.220 --> 15:59.980
Zhi.

16:02.939 --> 16:04.419
I'm the one who should thank you.

16:05.140 --> 16:06.779
You rescued me from that terrible place.

16:07.260 --> 16:08.299
Sit down, Zhi.

16:10.340 --> 16:12.100
Zhi is covered in injuries.

16:12.500 --> 16:14.340
It breaks my heart to see her like this.

16:15.500 --> 16:17.819
So Mister Lu and I discussed it

16:18.380 --> 16:19.860
and paid twenty taels of silver

16:20.140 --> 16:21.579
to buy her freedom.

16:23.459 --> 16:24.539
Once I get home,

16:25.340 --> 16:26.664
I'll definitely pay you back.

16:29.659 --> 16:30.500
There's no need.

16:33.340 --> 16:34.620
Once you're home,

16:35.020 --> 16:36.500
live a good life.

16:37.059 --> 16:38.419
If you ever need anything,

16:39.579 --> 16:41.220
you can come to us.

16:45.860 --> 16:46.500
Seventh Master.

16:47.380 --> 16:48.340
The carriage is ready.

16:48.620 --> 16:49.459
Young Lady Zhi,

16:49.539 --> 16:50.299
you can leave now.

17:10.259 --> 17:12.580
Thank you, Mister Lu and Uncle Xu.

17:12.739 --> 17:13.820
You saved my life.

17:14.459 --> 17:15.179
No.

17:15.179 --> 17:16.019
Get up.

17:16.019 --> 17:16.979
Get up, Zhi.

17:17.259 --> 17:17.699
Come.

17:26.100 --> 17:27.192
You should get going.

17:35.660 --> 17:41.180
♪The wind scatters the clouds,
and rain turns to mud♪

17:41.620 --> 17:46.740
♪Memories of the past rise in my heart♪

17:48.419 --> 17:48.900
(Ji'er.)

17:49.340 --> 17:50.820
(I'll come back and buy your freedom.)

17:52.259 --> 17:53.019
(All right.)

17:54.300 --> 17:55.304
(I'll wait for you.)

17:58.380 --> 17:59.499
Thinking about Ji'er?

18:01.620 --> 18:04.060
I hope that merchant is a good man

18:05.219 --> 18:06.459
and treats Ji'er well.

18:10.860 --> 18:12.419
I think the hardest thing in life

18:13.419 --> 18:15.100
is having nothing to hope for.

18:16.380 --> 18:18.179
As long as
there's something to hope for,

18:18.580 --> 18:21.340
you can endure any hardship.

18:24.659 --> 18:26.179
Ji'er must know in her heart

18:26.300 --> 18:27.699
that you'll find her.

18:28.459 --> 18:30.219
So she'll surely stay strong

18:31.219 --> 18:32.300
and wait for you.

18:37.340 --> 18:39.860
♪I watch the passing years wear away♪

18:39.860 --> 18:43.500
♪Even deep affection slowly fades♪

18:43.500 --> 18:50.380
♪The past falls like
withered leaves into the dust♪

18:55.540 --> 18:56.340
Eat some more.

19:05.900 --> 19:06.979
Now that Uncle Xu is back,

19:07.699 --> 19:08.259
Mother,

19:08.780 --> 19:09.860
ask the matchmaker to hurry

19:10.040 --> 19:12.488
and propose to the Xu family
as soon as possible.

19:14.019 --> 19:15.259
Silly boy.

19:15.340 --> 19:17.620
Marriage arrangements can't be rushed.

19:18.376 --> 19:20.540
Before she visits,
she needs to consult the almanac

19:20.540 --> 19:21.900
and choose an auspicious day.

19:28.300 --> 19:28.820
His Majesty

19:29.580 --> 19:30.699
may not have much time left.

19:33.179 --> 19:35.540
When that happens,
we'll have to observe national mourning,

19:35.960 --> 19:37.288
and marriages will be forbidden.

19:37.860 --> 19:39.140
I hold an official degree,

19:39.608 --> 19:42.344
so it's possible I won't be allowed
to discuss marriage for a year.

19:45.820 --> 19:47.140
You have a point.

19:49.860 --> 19:50.300
Then

19:50.979 --> 19:52.739
I'll speak to the matchmaker today

19:52.860 --> 19:54.019
and have her choose

19:54.019 --> 19:55.419
the earliest auspicious day.

19:57.340 --> 19:58.140
Thank you, Mother.

19:59.540 --> 20:01.499
Whenever I brought up marriage before,

20:01.499 --> 20:03.060
no amount of urging could persuade you.

20:03.410 --> 20:06.712
Now you act as though you're
afraid your bride will slip away.

20:07.699 --> 20:09.540
Why are you suddenly in such a hurry?

20:11.780 --> 20:12.820
Don't worry.

20:13.060 --> 20:14.419
Lanxiang's mother and I

20:14.580 --> 20:16.739
have already
discussed nearly everything.

20:16.860 --> 20:19.699
All that's left is for the matchmaker
to make it official.

20:21.336 --> 20:22.936
No one knows what the future may bring.

20:23.019 --> 20:25.060
It never hurts to be cautious.

20:26.380 --> 20:27.060
Yes.

20:35.740 --> 20:39.820
(The Capital)

20:52.019 --> 20:52.939
Crown Prince.

20:56.300 --> 20:57.699
Crown Prince.

20:58.900 --> 21:00.300
Crown Prince.

21:03.620 --> 21:06.380
The imperial decree summoning
His Highness back to the capital

21:06.939 --> 21:08.939
was sent to Jinling by urgent courier.

21:09.128 --> 21:11.496
(Zhao Jin, Zhao Xingtang's Grandfather)
It's been exactly thirty-one days.

21:11.500 --> 21:12.710
(First-Rank)
By my reckoning,

21:12.728 --> 21:15.960
(Junior Guardian and Minister of Personnel)
His Highness should have returned long ago.

21:20.019 --> 21:20.820
Father.

21:21.352 --> 21:23.352
(Prince Han)
My brother must

21:23.360 --> 21:24.690
have been delayed by something.

21:25.820 --> 21:27.100
Please wait a little longer.

21:33.140 --> 21:33.979
You...

21:35.300 --> 21:36.780
You beast!

21:38.980 --> 21:41.620
(Xie Shilian, Second-Rank,
Junior Tutor to the Crown Prince)

21:45.060 --> 21:46.459
You...

21:48.140 --> 21:48.739
Father.

21:49.419 --> 21:51.179
You beast!

21:51.300 --> 21:52.140
Father.

21:52.540 --> 21:53.699
What did you say?

21:54.659 --> 21:55.939
I understand.

21:56.179 --> 21:59.219
I will shoulder this responsibility.

22:06.060 --> 22:06.860
Father.

22:07.620 --> 22:10.259
The Crown Prince has returned!

22:13.540 --> 22:14.739
Your Majesty!

22:15.499 --> 22:18.499
His Highness has returned!

22:24.499 --> 22:25.979
Summon him.

22:35.699 --> 22:36.300
Father.

22:36.860 --> 22:37.820
I'm back.

22:50.659 --> 22:53.699
To preserve and carry on
what has been entrusted to you,

22:55.780 --> 22:57.459
always remain reverent and vigilant.

22:58.419 --> 23:02.780
Take as your own our ancestors'
concern for all under Heaven,

23:03.459 --> 23:05.780
and you shall forever retain
the Mandate of Heaven.

23:06.219 --> 23:07.100
I will remember.

23:08.380 --> 23:11.019
Take as my own our ancestors'
concern for all under Heaven.

23:23.140 --> 23:23.860
Father.

23:25.739 --> 23:28.419
Father!

23:29.739 --> 23:33.179
Father!

23:36.380 --> 23:38.340
Father!

23:54.060 --> 23:58.699
(Imperial Princes,
Regional Princes, and Princesses)

23:59.100 --> 24:00.936
(shall wear
the severest mourning attire)

24:01.780 --> 24:03.459
(for twenty-seven days.)

24:05.380 --> 24:08.540
(All subjects under Heaven
shall mourn for three days)

24:08.696 --> 24:10.450
(and then put off
their mourning attire,)

24:11.650 --> 24:13.752
(so as not to disrupt
the people's livelihoods)

24:14.179 --> 24:15.580
(or interfere with marriages.)

24:59.580 --> 25:01.860
(Your unfilial daughter, Shen Jialan,)

25:03.739 --> 25:06.459
(respectfully informs
parents and grandparents,)

25:06.568 --> 25:08.504
(and all her relatives
of the Shen family,)

25:09.368 --> 25:11.848
(that the man who ordered
the execution of the Shen family)

25:12.780 --> 25:13.739
(is dead.)

25:28.820 --> 25:30.780
I'll burn
some paper offerings for you, too.

26:15.780 --> 26:17.259
I smelled smoke

26:19.580 --> 26:21.580
and thought there was a fire somewhere.

26:24.419 --> 26:26.380
Who are you burning paper offerings for?

26:26.860 --> 26:28.060
Mister Lu...

26:29.300 --> 26:30.739
The late Emperor left a final decree

26:31.540 --> 26:32.380
forbidding

26:33.340 --> 26:36.380
any burden on the people
or wasteful spending on his funeral.

26:37.900 --> 26:39.019
All our neighbors

26:39.459 --> 26:42.620
have praised the late Emperor
for caring for his people.

26:43.340 --> 26:44.820
So we're just paying our respects.

26:45.580 --> 26:46.580
Mister Lu, would you like

26:47.080 --> 26:49.528
to offer some incense
and burn some paper offerings?

26:57.100 --> 26:59.340
Because he rebelled
and proclaimed himself Emperor,

27:02.179 --> 27:05.780
I'm the only one left alive
in the Lu family.

27:08.780 --> 27:11.179
Offer incense and burn paper for him?

27:16.219 --> 27:20.459
I'd rather clap my hands

27:20.540 --> 27:22.939
and celebrate his death.

27:53.019 --> 27:53.699
Mister Lu...

27:53.816 --> 27:56.440
We're paying respects
to Grand Secretary Shen and his family.

27:59.259 --> 28:00.340
Lanxiang, you...

28:08.100 --> 28:08.979
Many years ago,

28:09.659 --> 28:10.820
I fell gravely ill.

28:11.540 --> 28:13.659
My parents took me
everywhere seeking treatment.

28:14.264 --> 28:15.900
When they had nowhere left to turn,

28:16.900 --> 28:18.648
they happened
to meet First Madam Shen.

28:18.979 --> 28:20.580
She gave my parents ten taels of silver,

28:21.580 --> 28:22.580
and that saved my life.

28:44.140 --> 28:45.179
Yes.

28:51.140 --> 28:52.979
I see.

28:53.448 --> 28:56.264
Mister Lu, would you like to burn
some paper offerings for your family?

29:10.979 --> 29:12.939
Every parent

29:15.540 --> 29:18.100
wants their children

29:18.659 --> 29:20.380
to live well.

29:22.979 --> 29:23.780
Lanxiang.

29:26.100 --> 29:27.620
Don't be like me

29:29.419 --> 29:31.179
and make your parents worry.

29:34.940 --> 29:41.860
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

29:43.699 --> 29:47.140
You should marry
and build a life of your own,

29:50.259 --> 29:52.540
have a house full
of children and grandchildren,

29:54.780 --> 29:57.620
and live a life filled
with warmth and laughter,

29:59.699 --> 30:01.620
a life full of purpose and passion.

30:01.620 --> 30:05.420
♪The joys and sorrows
of the past quietly dwell here♪

30:05.420 --> 30:10.100
♪With my own hands and heart♪

30:10.100 --> 30:13.460
♪I write my name♪

30:14.180 --> 30:20.900
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

30:20.900 --> 30:25.180
♪With what I know and what I do♪

30:25.180 --> 30:28.420
♪I rewrite my fate♪

30:28.420 --> 30:39.060
♪The long night is almost over,
and I no longer dwell on the past♪

30:50.140 --> 30:56.860
♪Every word carries countless thoughts♪

30:57.540 --> 31:05.060
♪The encounters of half a lifetime
are kept within this little world♪

31:05.060 --> 31:12.260
♪Bit by bit, the passing years
become the preface♪

31:12.660 --> 31:15.140
♪The joys and sorrows of the past♪

31:15.140 --> 31:20.820
♪Quietly dwell here♪

31:20.820 --> 31:25.140
♪With my own hands and heart♪

31:25.140 --> 31:28.780
♪I write my name♪

31:29.180 --> 31:35.940
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

31:35.940 --> 31:40.220
♪With what I know and what I do♪

31:40.220 --> 31:43.500
♪I rewrite my fate♪

31:43.500 --> 31:46.219
Lotus pods!

31:46.219 --> 31:47.740
(Half a Month Later)

31:47.848 --> 31:48.930
Lotus seeds and lotus pods!

31:49.340 --> 31:50.820
Fresh lotus seeds!

31:54.179 --> 31:54.979
Lotus seeds!

32:18.019 --> 32:18.820
My dear brother.

32:18.904 --> 32:20.440
There's only a wall between your homes.

32:20.620 --> 32:23.380
It's not as if Lanxiang's parents
don't know what you look like.

32:25.419 --> 32:27.259
The matchmaker
has already spoken to them,

32:27.659 --> 32:30.019
and Lanxiang's parents
have given their consent.

32:30.860 --> 32:32.219
What are you still nervous about?

32:32.290 --> 32:34.110
When a matchmaker
comes to discuss a marriage,

32:34.120 --> 32:36.184
it's only to ask
for the woman's family's consent.

32:36.190 --> 32:38.216
The betrothal gifts
must be formally presented

32:38.280 --> 32:39.820
before the marriage is truly settled.

32:41.179 --> 32:42.780
Surely you're not worried

32:42.780 --> 32:44.979
your future parents-in-law
will change their minds?

32:46.739 --> 32:47.419
All right.

32:47.419 --> 32:47.900
Then

32:48.060 --> 32:49.419
hurry and bring the wild goose.

32:49.580 --> 32:50.060
Let's go.

33:10.860 --> 33:11.620
Coming!

33:12.219 --> 33:13.019
Guihua.

33:14.140 --> 33:14.659
Come in.

33:14.780 --> 33:15.659
Come in, child.

33:25.939 --> 33:26.340
All right.

33:43.219 --> 33:45.019
The eldest son, Han Liang,

33:45.540 --> 33:47.300
has now come of age

33:47.739 --> 33:49.060
but has yet to take a wife.

33:49.448 --> 33:50.970
Your daughter has found favor with us,

33:51.419 --> 33:53.140
and we seek her hand for Liang.

33:53.540 --> 33:56.019
Following the ancestral rites
of the Han family,

33:56.340 --> 33:58.979
we present a wild goose today
as the betrothal token

34:00.900 --> 34:01.699
to seek...

34:27.896 --> 34:29.710
Why is everyone
heading to the Xu residence?

34:29.720 --> 34:31.340
Did they do something wrong?

34:39.419 --> 34:42.019
Xu Wanquan, receive the imperial decree.

34:54.139 --> 34:56.459
This is a decree
from the reigning Emperor.

34:56.700 --> 34:59.220
All of you,
kneel and receive the decree.

35:43.300 --> 35:46.180
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor

35:46.539 --> 35:47.619
hereby decrees.

35:48.220 --> 35:51.459
Lin Jinqi,
Commander of the Shence Garrison,

35:51.750 --> 35:53.144
has served the realm with loyalty

35:53.192 --> 35:55.520
and rendered meritorious service
in protecting the Emperor.

35:55.539 --> 35:57.139
As he has reached the age of marriage,

35:57.820 --> 36:00.220
a virtuous lady
shall be chosen as his wife.

36:00.380 --> 36:03.419
Young Laday Xu, daughter of Xu Wanquan,

36:03.740 --> 36:05.419
is gentle and kind,

36:05.979 --> 36:07.780
virtuous and accomplished.

36:08.499 --> 36:10.660
To bring about this worthy union,

36:11.220 --> 36:14.419
she is hereby bestowed
in marriage to Lin Jinqi.

36:26.904 --> 36:29.848
It is hereby ordered that an auspicious
day be chosen for the wedding.

36:29.912 --> 36:31.260
May you live together in harmony,

36:31.660 --> 36:33.220
and not disappoint my expectations.

36:33.740 --> 36:35.579
Respect this decree.

36:38.660 --> 36:43.020
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

36:44.980 --> 36:48.740
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

36:49.500 --> 36:52.020
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

36:52.780 --> 36:54.620
♪Though all the world may fade♪

36:54.620 --> 36:57.900
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

36:59.700 --> 37:04.060
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

37:09.340 --> 37:11.380
Xu Wanquan's daughter?

37:15.939 --> 37:16.579
Shunhua.

37:17.059 --> 37:19.619
I've thought of every
prominent family in Jinling,

37:20.740 --> 37:21.700
but I still can't think

37:22.499 --> 37:23.939
which Young Lady Xu this could be.

37:25.499 --> 37:27.019
A prominent family?

37:27.019 --> 37:31.140
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

37:31.420 --> 37:34.340
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

37:34.459 --> 37:38.139
The daughter-in-law I chose so carefully

37:40.619 --> 37:42.860
turns out to be a maid?

37:50.220 --> 37:51.939
Xu Lanxiang is a maid?

37:52.459 --> 37:53.860
How could she be a maid?

37:54.979 --> 37:56.459
A maid...

37:56.459 --> 37:57.980
(Jiang Lantian, Lin Jinqi's Grandmother,
Old Madam of the Lin Family)

37:58.139 --> 37:58.740
A...

37:59.300 --> 38:00.380
maid...

38:03.939 --> 38:04.660
Aunt Shunhua!

38:05.752 --> 38:06.700
Go get a physician!

38:08.139 --> 38:09.019
Press her philtrum!

38:10.616 --> 38:11.530
- Mother!
- Guihua!

38:12.744 --> 38:13.570
- Mother!
- Guihua!

38:14.459 --> 38:15.419
Quick, get some water!

38:15.539 --> 38:16.059
Water!

38:16.059 --> 38:18.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

38:18.100 --> 38:21.860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

38:22.780 --> 38:23.660
Why?

38:23.979 --> 38:25.700
Why did it turn out like this?

38:30.619 --> 38:31.419
How...

38:33.900 --> 38:35.300
How could this happen?

38:38.099 --> 38:39.979
Why did they make you go back?

38:41.260 --> 38:43.499
Why did this happen?

38:45.420 --> 38:48.180
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

38:48.180 --> 38:51.940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

38:52.900 --> 38:53.900
It's all my fault.

38:54.900 --> 38:55.900
It's all my fault.

39:03.539 --> 39:04.260
Marriage has

39:04.504 --> 39:07.180
always been decided by the parents
and arranged by a matchmaker.

39:07.240 --> 39:09.512
I'll go to the county office
and see the magistrate.

39:09.960 --> 39:11.410
I'll ask them to petition the Emperor

39:11.619 --> 39:12.900
to revoke the imperial decree.

39:13.180 --> 39:14.380
We'll tell them that

39:14.440 --> 39:16.300
your father and I
won't agree to this marriage.

39:16.310 --> 39:18.300
We won't agree to the marriage between
you and Young Master Lin.

39:18.300 --> 39:18.979
No.

39:19.220 --> 39:20.499
No, it can't.

39:20.619 --> 39:22.019
We'll petition the Emperor

39:22.139 --> 39:23.300
to revoke the imperial decree.

39:23.300 --> 39:25.900
Yes, we'll go to the authorities
and return the imperial decree.

39:25.939 --> 39:26.539
Father.

39:27.059 --> 39:27.900
Mother, you can't.

39:27.900 --> 39:28.860
We'll return it.

39:28.930 --> 39:30.936
Yes, we'll go to the authorities!

39:30.968 --> 39:32.720
We'll give
the imperial decree back to them.

39:32.744 --> 39:33.130
You can't.

39:33.340 --> 39:34.059
Lanxiang.

39:34.059 --> 39:35.059
Uncle Xu. Aunt Xu.

39:40.419 --> 39:41.220
You mustn't go.

39:43.180 --> 39:43.860
Scholar Han...

39:45.660 --> 39:46.340
This...

39:47.939 --> 39:49.780
Our Xu family has wronged you.

39:52.059 --> 39:53.820
Even if it costs me my life today,

39:53.820 --> 39:55.860
I'm going to return
this imperial decree.

39:56.099 --> 39:56.619
Father.

39:56.620 --> 39:57.610
- Uncle Xu!
- Father!

39:57.620 --> 39:59.100
- I'm going to return it!
- Uncle Xu!

39:59.112 --> 39:59.848
Wanquan!

40:06.300 --> 40:08.139
Your wife may not be educated,

40:08.740 --> 40:10.139
but aren't you educated either?

40:11.939 --> 40:13.220
The Emperor's word is absolute,

40:13.220 --> 40:14.539
and his decree is law.

40:14.700 --> 40:15.740
Don't you know that?

40:17.939 --> 40:20.700
Even without an imperial decree
written in black and white,

40:21.260 --> 40:24.619
the Emperor's spoken word

40:25.939 --> 40:28.300
can never be taken back!

40:40.979 --> 40:43.099
You may be stubborn enough

40:43.619 --> 40:45.220
not to fear losing your heads,

40:49.380 --> 40:50.660
but what about Lanxiang?

40:52.260 --> 40:53.220
Lanxiang

40:54.539 --> 40:56.619
will lose her head along with you.

41:02.979 --> 41:03.740
Really?

41:07.139 --> 41:08.419
A father guides his children.

41:09.499 --> 41:10.539
When it comes to marriage,

41:11.260 --> 41:13.019
children must indeed obey their parents.

41:14.820 --> 41:16.139
But before that comes

41:16.296 --> 41:18.216
the sovereign's authority
over his subjects.

41:19.860 --> 41:22.180
All within the realm
are subjects of the sovereign.

41:23.660 --> 41:24.700
Everyone

41:26.700 --> 41:29.180
under Heaven must obey the Emperor.

41:33.740 --> 41:35.619
But what if the Emperor is wrong?

41:42.539 --> 41:44.260
How could the Emperor be wrong?

41:47.640 --> 41:49.090
Whether thunder or gentle rain,

41:49.624 --> 41:50.930
all are the sovereign's grace.

41:52.619 --> 41:54.099
If anyone thinks otherwise,

41:56.499 --> 41:58.059
then that person must be wrong.

41:58.139 --> 41:59.579
And that person deserves to die.

42:06.780 --> 42:08.939
I can't bear to see you go back there.

42:11.780 --> 42:12.939
I'll be fine,

42:13.900 --> 42:14.660
Mother.

42:15.939 --> 42:16.900
I'll be fine.

42:19.700 --> 42:20.700
I'll be fine, Father.

42:22.700 --> 42:24.579
I'm only entering
the Lin Residence again.

42:25.539 --> 42:26.660
Last time I entered,

42:27.700 --> 42:29.780
I survived perfectly well
even as a maid.

42:31.300 --> 42:32.019
This time,

42:33.419 --> 42:35.099
I'm going there as a Young Madam.

42:37.419 --> 42:38.820
I'll live an even better life.

42:47.660 --> 42:48.340
I'll be fine.

42:50.579 --> 42:51.300
I'll be fine.

42:53.860 --> 42:54.579
I'll be fine.

42:59.220 --> 42:59.939
I'll be fine.

43:05.300 --> 43:07.340
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.459 --> 43:09.539
I love Young Laday Xu

43:10.260 --> 43:11.340
and want to marry her.

43:12.220 --> 43:13.979
I knew parents and elders
would never agree,

43:14.820 --> 43:16.019
so I came up with this plan

43:16.216 --> 43:17.970
to bypass the elders of the family

43:18.232 --> 43:20.552
and petition His Majesty
directly for an imperial decree.

43:23.740 --> 43:24.579
You unfilial son.

43:25.340 --> 43:27.019
Look at the unfilial son you've raised!

43:31.220 --> 43:32.900
For your own selfish desires,

43:32.970 --> 43:34.792
you arranged your marriage
without telling us,

43:34.840 --> 43:36.472
disregarding the family's reputation

43:36.610 --> 43:38.536
and everything
your parents have done for you.

43:38.700 --> 43:40.979
This is a grave act of filial impiety!

43:57.020 --> 44:01.140
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:03.980 --> 44:08.500
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:09.780 --> 44:13.700
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:14.380 --> 44:17.140
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:17.860 --> 44:20.180
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:20.180 --> 44:23.260
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:24.780 --> 44:29.020
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:31.940 --> 44:36.100
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:37.900 --> 44:41.460
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:41.460 --> 44:45.020
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:45.820 --> 44:51.500
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:51.860 --> 44:56.180
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:56.540 --> 44:59.500
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:59.500 --> 45:03.260
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

